<!-- civix doesn't have an option to export OptionValues only. I worked around this by creating a dummy 
custom field group with the required fields that referred to the existing OptionGroups. Using the GUI it
isn't possible to select non-custom field OptionGroups so I created them with any old OptionGroup and then
modified them directly in the SQL table to refer to the paper_size and label_format OptionGroups' IDs.
Then I ran civix generate:custom-xml -data=<custom field group ID> optionvalues_install.xml
and then manually removed the custom field definitions from this xml file as well as the standard OptionValues.
